<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Countrywide Credit.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Countrywide Credit.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber upgraded Countrywide Credit Industries Inc to attractive from neutral based on the stock's price, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- The stock gained 1/4 to 24-3/4.</p>
</text>
